    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d215">

                <pb facs="0184" n="180" xml:id="pg180"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.30 Asiatic Fleet/578</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Navy Department to the
                            Department of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-09-01T09:30:00-04:00">September 1, 1938—9:30
                        a.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Commander in Chief, Asiatic Fleet, addressed the following despatch to the
                    Commanding Officer, U. S. S. <hi rendition="#italic">Oahu</hi>, yesterday
                    evening: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Call on Admiral Oikawa and tell him due to low provisions and fuel most
                            necessary <hi rendition="#italic">Monocacy</hi> leave for Shanghai by 10
                            September. It is almost three weeks since Japanese CinC<anchor n="36"
                                xml:id="d215-f1"/> was informed of need of early departure and by 10
                            September it will have been more than a month. Whatever the reason
                            given, the fact remains the channel is open through Matang and the
                            passage down river of one small vessel surely could not inconvenience
                            operations. Also inform him the <hi rendition="#italic">Monocacy</hi>
                            was refused access by the Japanese military to coal at Andersen Meyer’s
                            mill. Will greatly appreciate his help in moving <hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Monocacy</hi> to Shanghai prior to 10 September.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
